00:26:27,740 --> 00:26:30,380
The machine you see behind me is called a stuffer.

384
00:26:30,620 --> 00:26:33,360
Basically what the machine does is it takes brand new mailers,

385
00:26:33,620 --> 00:26:34,960
it takes DVDs that have orders.

386
00:26:35,540 --> 00:26:39,440
Suction cups pull the mailer apart, it inserts the disc into the mailer,

387
00:26:39,441 --> 00:26:41,600
it folds the top of the mailer around,

388
00:26:41,601 --> 00:26:45,880
removes the Atisa strip, seals the mailer, and gets it ready for its next process step.

389
00:26:46,420 --> 00:26:50,020
Netflix used to stuff the mailers by hand. Not fast enough.

390
00:26:50,900 --> 00:26:55,840
The mailer stuffer machine can run at about 4,200 units per hour, which is quite amazing.

391
00:26:56,200 --> 00:27:01,000
