395
00:27:13,680 --> 00:27:15,360
Within the space of about one foot,

396
00:27:15,980 --> 00:27:18,300
the computer will scan the barcode on the mailer,

397
00:27:18,900 --> 00:27:20,500
determine the customer that it's going to,

398
00:27:20,780 --> 00:27:23,060
and we'll print the outbound address to go out to the customer.

399
00:27:23,620 --> 00:27:26,120
The mailer sorter then sorts the mail

400
00:27:26,121 --> 00:27:28,480
by the first five digits of the customer's zip code.

401
00:27:29,240 --> 00:27:31,040
The DVDs are now ready to deliver.

402
00:27:33,180 --> 00:27:36,100
Each and every day, five truckloads of DVDs

403
00:27:36,101 --> 00:27:39,240
are shipped out from this facility to the United States Post Office

404
00:27:39,241 --> 00:27:41,660
and ultimately into our customers' hands.

405
00:27:42,360 --> 00:27:46,800
Nationwide, 112 truckloads worth of DVDs get shipped out on a daily basis.

406
00:27:47,140 --> 00:27:49,140
