407
00:27:49,740 --> 00:27:52,020
When the DVDs return the following morning,

408
00:27:52,460 --> 00:27:55,600
over 100 workers will open and inspect every disc for damages.

409
00:27:59,240 --> 00:28:03,120
Those that pass inspection get a quick cleaning and go back into the sorter.

